Subject: [PATCH] feat(alloc): loader-wide Vulkan allocation transaction (R46b
 B7b)

Gather every buffer-type/context group in llama_model::load_tensors before the
first driver allocation, reserve the whole set atomically, roll back on
failure. Independent review PASS. HQ load cells: 27B Q4_K_XL loads (rc 0);
84 GB model refused with 'cannot place all' before any allocation (rc 1).

