+# R46 B7b loader-wide transaction — independent Fable 5.1 LOW check
+
+Worktree `C:/ArifiLabs/cache/r46b-wt`, HEAD `6d8ed4c6f3fe86d513f39c8faec925e3dbfc7870`, uncommitted diff over
