+9. Final tree: sha256 of all four files recomputed now and equal to report §9. Plant census (`&& false`,
+   `if (false)`) in the three source files = 0. `git status` shows exactly the four modified files; nothing
+   committed.
+10. Receipts: every `*.rc` under `r46b-b7b-loader-evidence/` is rc=0 except the five reds; matches report §5 table.
+    Re-ran `build-vulkan/bin/test-alloc.exe` now: rc 0, 21 PASSED. Re-ran
+    `build-vulkan/bin/test-backend-ops.exe heapres` (WinLibs PATH): rc 0, `heapres: all tests passed`.
+11. Report honesty: §7 limits 1-8 verified true and complete against the code (loader not executed by tests;
+    single device; starvation accepted; re-census guard unplanted; longer concatenated list vs
+    `VK_PLAN_MAX_SEARCH_NODES` with `INDETERMINATE` promoted to whole-load refusal, message
+    `could not decide placement for all` distinguishes it from `cannot place all`; maintenance4 path; KV/compute
