+
+- `llama_model::load_tensors()` end-to-end on a real Vulkan device: needs the model load cell in report §8, not
+  run per mandate item 7.
+- Two real Vulkan devices: single-device rig.
+- Search-bound regression on a real 27B concatenated list: only the §8 cell shows it.
